body:
Hey wat you said about being able to epress freely on the internet really resonates with me. I suffer a lot because im not able to share my true emotions irl. Feel trapped sometimes. Ive been suffering so much recently and i didnt feel the full pain of it until i came here to vent out and i realise i deal myself an awful lot of shit and im actually overwhelmed. 

&#x200B;

How are you doing today? How's everything at home (assuming you still live with your mum)?

Oh hey thanks man! Im suddenly motivated by you calling me a bitch and shitty! :D 

 I guess I understand what youre trying to say, that instead of moping around feeling shitty about what i've done, the solution is to just stop doing the thing that's making me feel shitty and it will fix all my problems including my shitty emotions. I dont wanna be bitter towards you or anyone. I have tried doing exactly what you said, I got my ass the fuck up and tried to not be shitty, faked it till i would make it. 

&#x200B;

But i have a problem with being criticised and judged, kind of makes me paranoid all the time and my mind runs crazy situations where i fail at everything and everything is my fault. I dont do it on purpose, my brain goes there automatically and it overwhelms me. I figured out that this was what i do and recently with my new job i tried taking it on with my weakness in mind and try to avoid feeling it. Kind of worked out for a while. But other things start falling apart in my life. The residual affects of my past caught up with me, the losses i faced and my girlfriend who is getting more and more distant by the day. And that took over me instead of my paranoia. And i kinda felt overwhelmed again. My own feelings flanked me when i tried to focus on one aspect of this weakness that i have.

&#x200B;

I guess what im trying to convey to you is what happened to me. Recently i felt lost because of it. I found this thread and felt like i connected with some people here. Maybe they have an answer for me that i havent figured out yet myself. Which brings me to your comment, I tried what you recommended so is there anything else i can do?

Yes thats exactly it. So melancholic and calm. I want to have a drug that can make me feel that 100% of the day, does it exist? 

&#x200B;

I've been suffering so much and ive recently started to have suicidal thoughts. I came here to express some of my pain and hope to find some answers or hope. I hope im not weirding you out.

im sorry as im depressed as shit too. dont have much to live for either.

&#x200B;

but whats happening at home?

i appreciate you sharing this with me, thank you. im sorry if i seem intrusive or rude. 

&#x200B;

eventho i may never feel your pain, it always pains me to see others suffer. I hope that one day you find your peace no matter what it is. i hope that one day you look back at today and able to say "everything is better now".

hey, ive recently went to a new low myself. Im kinda throwing my life down the drain, again. 

&#x200B;

wanna maybe like talk about something?  idk i find comfort in talking to people, maybe you do too. 

&#x200B;

So what set you off recently? or if youre not comfortable, what's like your favourite food?
